            <ArticleTitle>H1N1 influenza in elderly nursing home residents.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>11-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.jamda.2009.10.011</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We offer this brief report to inform other nursing home medical directors and attending physicians of a possible change in the profile of persons susceptible to H1N1 influenza. If a significant number of cases appear in older persons, the recommendations for H1N1 vaccination may need to be changed to include the elderly.</AbstractText>
